@startuml
title Feature: Tell Story - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
participant Enemy
participant Princess
participant Hero
participant Story
Enemy -> Princess: setCaptured()
activate Princess
Princess --> Enemy: return
deactivate Princess
Hero -> Princess: release()
activate Princess
Princess --> Hero: return
deactivate Princess
Story -> Enemy: capture()
activate Enemy
Enemy --> Story: return
deactivate Enemy
Story -> Hero: fight()
activate Hero
Hero --> Story: return
deactivate Hero
Story -> Hero: save()
activate Hero
Hero --> Story: return
deactivate Hero
